  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forsknssam Hnd 05-08</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Honduras 05-08 - Sv. institutet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forskningssamarbete med UNAH, det autonoma universitetet i Honduras. Kapacitetsutveckling f&#xF6;r forskning och forskningsf&#xF6;rvaltning. Inkluderar st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r universitetsreformen, IT-utveckling,  biblioteksutveckling och doktorandprogram inom geovetenskap och mikrobiologi, sistn&#xE4;mnda med fokus p&#xE5; smittsamma sjukdomar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research cooperation with UNAH, the Autonomous University of Honduras. Capacity development for research and research management. Includes support for the university reform, development of ICT, library development and PhD programmes within Earth Sciences and microbiology, the last mentioned focussed on transmittable deseases.</narrative>
  </description>
